{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47527","headline":"七言 三十六 · 吕岩","name":"七言 三十六","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"金鎚灼灼舞天阶，独自骑龙去又来。\n高卧白云观日窟，闲眠秋月擘天开。\n离花片片乾坤产，坎蘂翻翻造化栽。\n晚醉九岩回首望，北邙山下骨皑皑。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吕岩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47527.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47527","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}